-- **A recursive call inside a `retry` loop** -- the third of the shapes
-- `contract_of_duty_rec_loop_in` refused (`programmlogik/PLAN.md` §9.3).
--
-- The refusal read *"the recursive call stands inside a `retry`/`forever` loop, which has no
-- index range to induct over; a `traverse` has one"*, and **the ground was wrong**: the
-- induction is over the `decreases`, never over the loop index. What a range buys is
-- `lo <= k < hi` inside the pass -- an assumption the pass RECEIVES, not a premise of the
-- composition -- and `looprule_of_body` builds the rule of a rangeless loop without one. So
-- the model needed one more theorem (`contract_of_duty_rec_loop`) that differs from the
-- ranged one in exactly which loop-rule builder stands inside the induction.
--
-- The `until` is a plain condition over a global, not a device register: the point of the
-- probe is the loop's SHAPE, and a device promise would add an assumption that has nothing
-- to do with it.
--
-- **And there is no `progress` here, for the same reason and one more** (2026-09-08). The
-- clause is optional, and what ends this loop is its own body: `stand = 1` is the first
-- statement of the pass, so `until stand >= 1` holds after one pass and nobody outside the
-- program has to promise anything.
--
-- The first version of this file did carry one -- `progress jemand_zaehlt_hoch`, with an
-- `assume` behind it and `falsifier sonde_jemand_zaehlt_hoch` behind that. **There is no
-- program of that name**, and a `falsifier` naming a probe that does not exist is an
-- unfalsifiable assumption wearing a falsifiable one's clothes (`dokumente/UNFALSIFIZIERBAR.md`).
-- `instrumente/pruefe-sondendeckung.py` said so at once and in the right way: the name pushed
-- its `aussen` count from 13 to 14, its own speech test then failed, and the run ABORTED
-- before printing the six numbers `pruefe-zahlen.py` reads -- so `pruefe-zahlen.py` went from
-- 5 findings to 11, and **all six of the new ones** read *"der Befehl druckt die Zahl nicht
-- mehr ... der Suchweg ist ab"*. The instrument's header describes the same accident from an
-- earlier day, one word of a comment wide.
--
-- *The way out was not a probe program and not a raised mark.* An assumption this file does
-- not need is an assumption this file does not state.

module probe::rekursion_in_retry {

const TIEFE : u32 = 8;

static mut stand : u32 in 0 .. 255 = 0;

extern fn zeitablauf() -> never effects { diverges } costs <= 1 ops;

impl fn absteigen(n : u32 in 0 .. TIEFE)
    ensures  stand <= 255
    effects  { reads stand, writes stand }
    costs    <= 65536 ops
    decreases n
{
    retry runde until stand >= 1
        bounded 1024 ops
        on_exceeded zeitablauf
        effects   { reads stand, writes stand }
        invariant n <= TIEFE
    {
        stand = 1;
        if n > 0 { absteigen(n - 1); }
    }
}

}
